// preference, adversarial. The bench reports R@5/R@10/Div@5 per category.
//
// Seed categories with 10-20 queries each for a ~100-query gold set. Queries
// that mention obvious keywords belong in factual-lookup. Queries that need
// to combine two facts belong in multi-hop. Queries that depend on "most
// recent" or "last time" belong in temporal. Queries about a user/team/person
// preference belong in preference. Queries designed to mislead the retriever
// (near-duplicate bait, wrong-category hint) belong in adversarial.
